{"id":"G4991","lemma":"σωτηρία","transliteration":"sōtēria","sayIt":"sōtēria","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, feminine","gloss":"salvation","meaning":"σωτηρία, -ας, ἡ\n(σωτήρ), [in LXX for יֶשַׁע, יְשׁוּעָה, תְּשׁוּעָה, פְּלֵיטָה, etc. ;]\ndeliverance, preservation, salvation, safety (Lat. salus): Act.7:25 27:34, Heb.11:7; ἐξ ἐχθρῶν, Luk.1:71. In NT esp. of Messianic and spiritual salvation (see: σώζω): Luk.19:9, Jhn.4:22, Act.4:12 13:47, Rom.11:11, 2Th.2:13, 2Ti.3:15, Heb.2:3 6:9, 2Pe.3:15, Ju 3; opposite to ἀπηώλεια, Php.1:28; αἰώνιος-., Heb.5:9; ὁ λόγος (τὸ εὐαγγέλιον) τῆς σ., Act.13:26, Eph.1:13; ὁδὸς σωτηρίας, Act.16:17; κέρας σωτηρίας, Luk.1:69; ἡμέρα σωτηρίας, 2Co.6:2 (LXX); κατεργάζεσθαι τὴν ἑαυτοῦ σ., Php.2:12; κληρονομεῖν σ., Heb.1:14; ὁ ἀρχηγὸς τῆς σ., Heb.2:10; εἰς σ., Rom.1:16 10:1, 10, 1Pe.2:2; σ. as a present possession (see: σώζω), Luk.1:77, 2Co.1:6 7:10, Php.1:19, 2Ti.2:10; as more fully realized in the future: Rom.13:11, 1Th.5:8-9, Heb.9:28, 1Pe.1:5 1:9-10, Rev.7:10 12:10 19:1.†\n(AS)","glosses":["salvation","saved","deliver them","been","preservation","salvation has come"],"count":48,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"luk-1","v":69,"renderings":{"bsb":"of salvation","kjv":"of salvation"}},{"chapterId":"luk-1","v":71,"renderings":{"bsb":"salvation","kjv":"That we should be saved"}},{"chapterId":"luk-1","v":77,"renderings":{"bsb":"of salvation","kjv":"of salvation"}},{"chapterId":"luk-3","v":6,"renderings":{}},{"chapterId":"luk-19","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"salvation","kjv":"salvation"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-4","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"salvation","kjv":"salvation"}},{"chapterId":"act-4","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Salvation","kjv":"salvation"}},{"chapterId":"act-7","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"to deliver them","kjv":"would deliver"}},{"chapterId":"act-13","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"been","kjv":"salvation"}},{"chapterId":"act-13","v":47,"renderings":{"bsb":"salvation","kjv":"salvation"}},{"chapterId":"act-16","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"of salvat